            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582783,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Claude Shannon's Early Life</strong><br>\nClaude Shannon was born in 1916 in Petoskey, Michigan. From a young age, he showed an interest in mechanical and electrical systems, often experimenting with model airplanes and boats. Shannon's curiosity about how things worked led him to pursue his studies in mathematics and engineering. By the time he was in his twenties, Shannon had already made significant contributions to the field of digital circuit design theory.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Education and the Master's Thesis</strong><br>\nShannon attended the University of Michigan, where he studied electrical engineering and mathematics. He later went to MIT for his master's degree, where he wrote one of the most important master's theses ever. His thesis demonstrated how Boolean algebra could be used to simplify the arrangement of relays used in computing and telephone routing switches. This work laid the foundation for future digital circuit design.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Working at Bell Labs</strong><br>\nAfter completing his education, Shannon joined Bell Labs. This was during World War II, and his work was pivotal in developing cryptography and secure communication for the military. At Bell Labs, Shannon also developed the concepts that would form the basis of information theory. His insights revolutionized the understanding of communication processes and the storage of information.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "53bc5361-5ce5-43a9-a00f-57bbceee9cd0"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
